<title>UK: LME - warehouse stock movements.</title>
<headline>LME - warehouse stock movements.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, May 14 - Latest LME warehouse stock changes are:</p>
<p>copper down 2825, tin up 75, lead up 725, zinc down 775,</p>
<p>aluminium down 3175, nickel up 192, aluminium alloy down 280</p>
</text>
